{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S12把“想把能给的都给对方”改成“让对方安心”，S13又省掉了他因害怕失去亲近而想把喜欢藏回去的前因，人物动机不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的话句用加亮抓住心理落点，交替排列也让我更容易在听音乐时迅速找到每段重点；感受部分则有更多具体的音色、触感、身体反应和情绪变化，而且到时出现的设计能让我把感受和音乐进程对应起来。X的优势是人物动机交代得更完整，尤其是从害怕暴露喜欢到害怕失去亲近，再到不愿重新隐藏的心理转变，因果关系更清楚。整体我选Y，因为作为普通观众，我更容易边听边抓住重点，也更容易获得细腻、具体的音乐体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f6ffdb13-ebce-48cd-9212-c4daaf3180c9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T225217421227Z", "elapsed_seconds": 45.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:53:02.520007+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "75432059554784058bebfdee05124311c62df0cd2c7ebafe90e4363b6bd95754", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683"